WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.870
Four Yemenis young and old a ceasefire can't come soon enough

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:10.590
As many as 18 million people more than half the country are close to starvation

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.809
Four years of conflict have brought Yemen to its knees

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:22.410
We have no shelter. We have nothing. We don't even have water our children are sick

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:27.539
Doctors just can't keep up with the number of malnourished patients

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:38.520
We receive 25 malnutrition cases every single week our capacity here is very limited

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:46.559
Renewed fighting flared up in the port city of heard a day late Monday

